    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-108-ss-1-logic-alleninterval-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person:  (i) accesses a stored communication; or  (ii) authorises, suffers or permits another person to access a stored communication; or  (iii) does any act or thing that will enable the person or another person to access a stored communication; and",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Accessing stored communications during knowledge of neither sender nor recipient.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "During",
      "cml:premiseText": "(1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person:  (i) accesses a stored communication; or  (ii) authorises, suffers or permits another person to access a stored communication; or  (iii) does any act or thing that will enable the person or another person to access a stored communication; and"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-108-ss-1-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person:  (i) accesses a stored communication; or  (ii) authorises, suffers or permits another person to access a stored communication; or  (iii) does any act or thing that will enable the person or another person to access a stored communication; and",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibits accessing stored communications without knowledge of sender and recipient.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibit",
      "cml:premiseText": "(1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person:  (i) accesses a stored communication; or  (ii) authorises, suffers or permits another person to access a stored communication; or  (iii) does any act or thing that will enable the person or another person to access a stored communication; and  (b) the person does so with the knowledge of neither of the following:  (i) the intended recipient of the stored communication;  (ii) the person who sent the stored communication."
    },
