      },
      "cml:operator": "Exclude",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) A reference in section 19 of the Ombudsman Act 1976 to the Ombudsman’s operations does not include a reference to anything that an inspecting officer has done or omitted to do under this Part."
    },
    {
